CaptionRequest.description:
POST …/ai/caption: ``write`` a caption from ``brief`` (what the post is about), or
``improve`` the ``caption`` given (required then). Written in the workspace's brand voice;
costs AI credits (caption_generation).

get.description:
Plan, status, entitlements, usage (AI credits, scheduled posts, knowledge characters),
trial eligibility (TR-BIL-05) and, from T8.2, the paid plans' prices from Dodo (cached 1 h;
empty when Dodo can't be reached).
